<title>FINLAND: Rautaruukki to build water handling plant.</title>
<headline>Rautaruukki to build water handling plant.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish steel group Rautaruukki Oy said in a statement on Wednesday its Raahe Steel unit will build a new water handling plant for 118 million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;Rautaruukki Raahe Steel will build a new water handling plant and a hot strip rolling mill to handle waters,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The building costs will be 118 million markka,&quot; it said.</p>
</text>
